# Prose-word budgets (scripts/doc-form.sh): path=N share=S. N is the measured prose words of each new page, so growth fails.
docs/operations/delegation.md=1969 share=10 # 1969 measured (+11: an HTTPS connection gives back an egress once decision; a spent host rule hold one never comes back); earlier: 1958 measured (+7: a host rule hold is session-wide only when approved for the run, and one-time when decided once); earlier: 1951 measured (+6: the one-time row says an unanswered HTTPS connection gives the approval back); earlier: 1945 measured: the three tiers of consent, who may consent to each kind, and when a running run loses each access
docs/operations/orchestrators.md=986 share=30 # measured: one background run per workflow step, what not to do, and a retried call that needs an approval
docs/GLOSSARY.md=480 share=10 # measured: each gateway, proxy and broker, what it is, where it runs and its page
